  "instructions": [
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine idli rice and urid dal and soak them in water for 4 hours.",
    "Drain the water and mix the rice and dal mixture with eggs, crushed almonds, cumin seeds, coriander seeds, turmeric powder, red chili powder, and salt.",
    "Heat coconut oil in a non-stick pan over medium heat and saut\u00194te the onion and ginger until the onion turns translucent.",
    "Add the chili pepper and cook for another minute."
